			"notes": "- Fixed bug with KoF api connection heartbeat, so raid lfgs should correctly display state changes (such as party filling up and you actually being able to party everyone)\n- Fixed once-per-minute nameplate flickering with Show Your Own nameplates\n- Fixed(?) issue with vanilla nametag dropshadow displaying in nameplates \n- Fixed Show who queued timers rolling down to the next line by increasing the wynntils hud element size to 370x110 upon turning on the feature and installing this version (if its broken for you right now installing this version should fix it). You can still change the box's size (Guild Attack Timers) afterwards and RALLE wont revert it.\n- Made modifier keybinds work with modifier menus (hold modifier key + modifier option keybind, e.g. if party create is on f10, holding f10 and holding then releasing 1 makes a Dailies party)\n- **Moved modifier wheels (Party create, party kick) to a new \"Wheels\" catagory in the settings.**\n- Added a new modifier style \"Bars\", alongside an option under all modifiers to switch between Circle Segments, Bars and No view\n- **Added a slight drop shadow under the KoF logo and under banner titles, making them significantly more legible for certain ui themes** \n- **Added three new ui themes (isothopicalbob, John Hell Emergency, Hatred)**\n- **Added a class switcher modifier wheel**\n  - RALLE takes your classes from your class book and are able to add/remove which classes you want to show up in the modifier menu. Class nicknames are supported and you can also edit the names that show up in the modifier menu (This does not change your wynn class nicknames!)\n  - You can also reorder how the classes are listed in the modifier menu by click and draging the classes around in the View (the class list thing with the button on the right)\n  - If you have more than 7 classes that you actively play and would add to the ralle modifier menu, it is **Highly** recommended to switch to Bars style.\n  - Testing shows that this class switcher is **51.67%** faster than switching classes manually! (Manual: 4.55s, Ralle: 3s, assuming the end is when the bubble column sound plays)\n  - This feature **Requires** Auto open to be turned on. (to speed it up)"
		},
